{"speciesId":71,"names":{"fr":"Empiflor","es":"Victreebel","en":"Victreebel","ja":"ウツボット"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"Said to live in huge colonies deep in jungles, although no one has ever returned from there."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"Said to live in huge colonies deep in jungles, although no one has ever returned from there."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"Lures prey with the sweet aroma of honey. Swallowed whole, the prey is melted in a day, bones and all."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"ACID that has dis­ solved many prey becomes sweeter, making it even more effective at attracting prey."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"This horrifying plant POKéMON at­ tracts prey with aromatic honey, then melts them in its mouth."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"Once ingested into this POKéMON's body, even the hardest object will melt into nothing."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"VICTREEBEL has a long vine that extends from its head. This vine is waved and flicked about as if it were an animal to attract prey. When an unsuspecting prey draws near, this POKéMON swallows it whole."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"VICTREEBEL has a long vine that extends from its head. This vine is waved and flicked about as if it were an animal to attract prey. When an unsuspecting prey draws near, this POKéMON swallows it whole."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"The long vine extending from its head is waved about as if it were a living thing to attract prey. When an unsuspecting victim approaches, it is swallowed whole."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Lures prey into its mouth with a honeylike aroma. The helpless prey is melted with a dissolving fluid."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Said to live in huge colonies deep in jungles, although no one has ever returned from there."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It pools in its mouth a fluid with a honeylike scent, which is really an acid that dissolves anything."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It pools in its mouth a fluid with a honeylike scent, which is really an acid that dissolves anything."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It pools in its mouth a fluid with a honeylike scent, which is really an acid that dissolves anything."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Acid that has dissolved many prey becomes sweeter, making it even more effective at attracting prey."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"This horrifying plant Pokémon attracts prey with aromatic honey, then melts them in its mouth."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Sa bouche sécrète un fluide à l’odeur de miel, qui s’avère être un acide extrêmement corrosif."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It pools in its mouth a fluid with a honeylike scent, which is really an acid that dissolves anything."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Sa bouche sécrète un fluide à l’odeur de miel, qui s’avère être un acide extrêmement corrosif."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It pools in its mouth a fluid with a honeylike scent, which is really an acid that dissolves anything."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It pools in its mouth a fluid with a honey-like scent, which is really an acid that dissolves anything."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It pools in its mouth a fluid with a honey-like scent, which is really an acid that dissolves anything."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"On dit qu’il vit en colonie dans la jungle, mais personne n’en est jamais revenu vivant pour le confirmer."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Dicen que vive en grandes colonias en el interior de las junglas, aunque nadie ha podido verificarlo."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Said to live in huge colonies deep in jungles, although no one has ever returned from there."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"ジャングルの 奥地に ウツボット ばかり いる 地帯が あって 行ったら ２度と 帰ってこれない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Tout corps ingéré par ce Pokémon est systématiquement dissous en bouillie."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando este Pokémon ingiere algo, incluso el objeto más duro se disolverá al instante."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Once ingested into this Pokémon’s body, even the hardest object will melt into nothing."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"体内に 取りこまれた ものは どんなに 硬くても 溶解液で 跡形なく 溶かされてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Empiflor est doté d’une longue liane qui part de sa tête. Cette liane se balance et remue comme un animal pour attirer ses proies. Lorsque l’une d’elles s’approche un peu trop près, ce Pokémon l’avale entièrement."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Victreebel tiene una enredadera que le sale de la cabeza y que agita a modo de señuelo para atraer a sus presas y así engullirlas por sorpresa cuando estas se aproximan incautas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Victreebel has a long vine that extends from its head. This vine is waved and flicked about as if it were an animal to attract prey. When an unsuspecting prey draws near, this Pokémon swallows it whole."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"頭に ついた 長い つるを 小さな 生き物の ように 動かし 獲物を 誘う。 近づいてきた ところを ぱくりと ひとのみ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Empiflor est doté d’une longue liane qui part de sa tête. Cette liane se balance et remue comme un animal pour attirer ses proies. Lorsque l’une d’elles s’approche un peu trop près, ce Pokémon l’avale entièrement."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Victreebel tiene una enredadera que le sale de la cabeza y que agita a modo de señuelo para atraer a sus presas y así engullirlas por sorpresa cuando estas se aproximan incautas."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Victreebel has a long vine that extends from its head. This vine is waved and flicked about as if it were an animal to attract prey. When an unsuspecting prey draws near, this Pokémon swallows it whole."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"頭に ついた 長い つるを 小さな 生き物の ように 動かし 獲物を 誘う。 近づいてきた ところを ぱくりと ひとのみ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Il attire ses proies avec une odeur de miel et les avale tout entières. Il les digère en un jour seulement, les os y compris."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Atrae a su presa con un dulce aroma a miel. Una vez atrapada en la boca, la disuelve en tan solo un día, huesos incluidos."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Lures prey with the sweet aroma of honey. Swallowed whole, the prey is dissolved in a day, bones and all."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"ミツの 香りで 獲物を 誘う。 口の中に 入れたものは １日で ホネまで 溶かしてしまうという。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Il attire ses proies avec une odeur de miel et les avale tout entières. Il les digère en un jour seulement, les os y compris."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Atrae a su presa con un dulce aroma a miel. Una vez atrapada en la boca, la disuelve en tan solo un día, huesos incluidos."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Lures prey with the sweet aroma of honey. Swallowed whole, the prey is dissolved in a day, bones and all."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"ミツの 香りで 獲物を 誘う。 口の中に 入れたものは １日で ホネまで 溶かしてしまうという。"}],"varieties":[{"id":71,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[19,"level-up",1],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[5,"machine